ot;During todayâ&#x80;&#x99;s ABA session, staff utilized Incidental Teaching and the Premack (First-Then) Strategy to address Taraâ&#x80;&#x99;s goal of testing the jmeter results. Staff presented opportunities for Tara to engage with the target â&#x80;&#x9c;Testing the jmeter results.â&#x80;&#x9d; Tara demonstrated independent responses on 12% of trials, indicating emerging independent use of this skill. Staff provided prompts and reinforcement as needed to encourage further progress. Tara responded positively to the First-Then approach, which helped maintain her engagement throughout the session. Continued focus on increasing her independent responses will be prioritized in future sessions to support further skill development in this area.&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteResponseId&quot;:null}],&quot;StartTime&quot;:&quot;00:00:00&quot;,&quot;EndTime&quot;:&quot;01:00:00&quot;}</stringProp>
