ot;:null,&quot;TreatmentClinicalGoalsAddressedId&quot;:41,&quot;GoalNo&quot;:10,&quot;GoalInterventions&quot;:[{&quot;InterventionRendId&quot;:&quot;${v_InterventionRendId}&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteInterventionId&quot;:null},{&quot;InterventionRendId&quot;:&quot;${v_InterventionRendId}&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteInterventionId&quot;:null}],&quot;GoalTargets&quot;:[{&quot;TargetName&quot;:&quot;Printing Jmeter results&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteTargetId&quot;:null}],&quot;GoalActivities&quot;:[],&quot;GoalAttachments&quot;:[],&quot;ObjectiveId&quot;:null,&quot;GoalSummary&quot;:&quot;Printing Jmeter results&quot;}],&quot;SupervisionModeled&quot;:&quot;Printing Jmeter results Printing Jmeter results&quot;,&quot;SupervisionReviewed&quot;:&quot;Printing Jmeter results Printing Jmeter results&quot;,&quot;SupervisionFeedback&quot;:&quot;Printing Jmeter results Printing Jmeter results&quot;,&quot;SupervisionDiscussion&quot;:&quot;Printing Jmeter results Printing Jmeter results&quot;,&quot;BillingCodeServiceId&quot;:3,&quot;SessionDate&quot;:&quot;${sessionDate_10}&quot;,&quot;AreasOfProgress&quot;:null,&quot;AreasLackOfProgress&quot;:null,&quot;AssessmentResult&quot;:0,&quot;SessionNoteTreatGoalResponseSummary&quot;:[{&quot;TreatmentClinicalGoalsAddressedId&quot;:43,&quot;Description&quot;:&quot;During todayâ&#x80;&#x99;s ABA session, staff utilized Modeling and Incidental Teaching strategies to support Tara in her goal of Printing Jmeter results. Staff presented the target â&#x80;&#x9c;Printing Jmeter results,â&#x80;&#x9d; and Tara demonstrated independent responses 12% of the time. Staff provided prompts and guidance as needed to encourage Taraâ&#x80;&#x99;s participation and understanding. While progress toward independence on this target remains slow, Tara showed engagement throughout the session. Staff will continue to use evidence-based strategies to increase her independent responding for this skill in future sessions, with a focus on gradually reducing prompts as she becomes more confident with the task.&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteResponseId&quot;:null},{&quot;TreatmentClinicalGoalsAddressedId&quot;:44,&quot;Description&quot;:&quot;During todayâ&#x80;&#x99;s ABA session, staff utilized Random Rotation and Social Stories to address Taraâ&#x80;&#x99;s goal of Printing Jmeter results. Tara demonstrated independent responses on 13% of opportunities for the target Printing Jmeter results, indicating emerging skills in this area. Staff provided support and encouragement throughout the session to promote engagement and understanding. Tara participated actively in activities, showing some progress but continues to require additional practice to increase her independent performance with this skill. Staff will continue using targeted strategies in future sessions to help Tara build confidence and further improve her ability to independently print Jmeter results.&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteResponseId&quot;:null},{&quot;TreatmentClinicalGoalsAddressedId&quot;:45,&quot;Description&quot;:&quot;During todayâ&#x80;&#x99;s ABA session, staff utilized Discrete Trial Training (DTT) and Chaining to address Taraâ&#x80;&#x99;s goal of printing Jmeter results. Staff presented multiple opportunities for Tara to practice this skill. She demonstrated independent responses on 12% of the trials, indicating that she is beginning to acquire the skill but continues to require support and prompting for most steps. Staff provided guidance as needed and reinforced her efforts throughout the session. Tara showed some engagement with the task, but further practice is necessary to increase her independent performance in printing Jmeter results. Continued focus on this target is recommended.&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteResponseId&quot;:null},{&quot;TreatmentClinicalGoalsAddressedId&quot;:46,&quot;Description&quot;:&quot;During todayâ&#x80;&#x99;s ABA session, staff implemented Chaining and Picture Exchange Communication System (PECS) to support Tara in her goal of printing Jmeter results. Staff presented the target â&#x80;&#x9c;Printing Jmeter results,â&#x80;&#x9d; and Tara demonstrated independent responses 12% of the time, indicating slow progress toward this goal. Staff provided prompts as needed to encourage Taraâ&#x80;&#x99;s participation and understanding throughout the activity. Visual supports were used via PECS to facilitate communication and task completion. Tara engaged with the materials but required frequent assistance for most steps, showing that she is still developing independence in this skill area. Continued practice is recommended.&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteResponseId&quot;:null},{&quot;TreatmentClinicalGoalsAddressedId&quot;:41,&quot;Description&quot;:&quot;During todayâ&#x80;&#x99;s ABA session, staff utilized shaping and role-playing strategies to support Tara in her goal of printing Jmeter results. Tara participated actively as staff guided her through each step of the process. She demonstrated independent responses on some occasions, achieving 34% independent performance for this target, which reflects medium progress toward mastery. Staff provided prompts and positive reinforcement to encourage further skill development. Tara responded well to the structured approach and showed increased engagement during role-playing activities related to printing Jmeter results. Continued focus on shaping and practice is recommended to help Tara increase her level of independence with this skill.&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteResponseId&quot;:null}],&quot;StartTime&quot;:&quot;00:10:00&quot;,&quot;EndTime&quot;:&quot;00:15:00&quot;}</stringProp>
                  <stringProp name="Argument.metadata">=</stringProp>
                </elementProp>
              </collectionProp>
            </elementProp>
          </HTTPSamplerProxy>
