            <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">https://uat-api.firstpath.co/api/timecard/AddEditChildSessionNote</stringProp>
            <stringProp name="HTTPSampler.domain">${BASE_URL_1}</stringProp>
            <stringProp name="HTTPSampler.port">0</stringProp>
            <stringProp name="HTTPSampler.protocol">https</stringProp>
            <stringProp name="HTTPSampler.path">api/timecard/AddEditChildSessionNote</stringProp>
            <boolProp name="HTTPSampler.follow_redirects">true</boolProp>
            <stringProp name="HTTPSampler.method">POST</stringProp>
            <boolProp name="HTTPSampler.use_keepalive">true</boolProp>
            <boolProp name="HTTPSampler.postBodyRaw">true</boolProp>
            <elementProp name="HTTPsampler.Arguments" elementType="Arguments">
              <collectionProp name="Arguments.arguments">
                <elementProp name="" elementType="HTTPArgument">
                  <boolProp name="HTTPArgument.always_encode">false</boolProp>
                  <stringProp name="Argument.value">{&quot;ChildId&quot;:6884,&quot;CenterUserId&quot;:4649,&quot;SessionNoteType&quot;:2,&quot;SessionNote&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;EngagementType&quot;:0,&quot;ProgressType&quot;:0,&quot;TodayNoteStatus&quot;:0,&quot;SignatureUrl&quot;:&quot;${v_clean_s3_url200}&quot;,&quot;SessionNoteMalaBehaveStatus&quot;:0,&quot;PlannedActivities&quot;:0,&quot;ProgramDelivery&quot;:0,&quot;OtherNoteStatus&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;OtherNote&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;IsDraft&quot;:false,&quot;BillingCodeServiceId&quot;:227,&quot;SessionDate&quot;:&quot;${sessionDate_12}&quot;,&quot;SamplingStartDate&quot;:&quot;2026-03-01&quot;,&quot;SamplingEndDate&quot;:&quot;2026-03-07&quot;,&quot;GoalProgressSummaryCategoryId&quot;:[43],&quot;MaladaptiveBehaviorCategoryId&quot;:[4],&quot;GoalProgressSummaryByCategory&quot;:[{&quot;TreatmentCategoryId&quot;:43,&quot;GoalProgressSummary&quot;:&quot;Testing and printing Jmeter results&quot;}],&quot;MaladaptiveBehaviorDataReviewByCategory&quot;:[{&quot;TreatmentCategoryId&quot;:4,&quot;CategoryName&quot;:&quot;Aggression&quot;,&quot;GoalProgressSummary&quot;:&quot;Testing and printing Jmeter results&quot;}],&quot;ProgressReviewType&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;ProgressReviewNote&quot;:&quot;Review of treatment data during the reporting period indicates continued progress across active treatment targets. Although some variability in responding was observed across sessions, data trends do not indicate limited progress or lack of progress. Based on this review, existing intervention protocols remain clinically appropriate and will continue to be implemented to support continued advancement toward treatment goals and maintenance of treatment gains through ongoing medically necessary ABA intervention.&quot;,&quot;ClinicalInterpretationOfTreatmentData&quot;:&quot;Review of treatment and behavior data indicates continued progress across active goals, with some session-to-session variability but no evidence of limited or stalled progress. Current intervention protocols remain appropriate and will continue to be implemented by direct-care staff to support ongoing skill acquisition and address maladaptive behaviors as clinically indicated. Ongoing data review will guide any future protocol adjustments to ensure alignment with the treatment plan and medical necessity.\nOngoing structured ABA intervention remains necessary to maintain treatment gains and promote generalization of skills across environments. ABA services, including ongoing BCBA clinical oversight, indirect treatment planning, and protocol modification, continue to be medically necessary to address skill deficits and improve functional communication, adaptive functioning, and behavioral regulation associated with Taraâ&#x80;&#x99;s diagnosis of Autism Spectrum Disorder.&quot;,&quot;PurposeOfIndirectService&quot;:&quot;Reviewed treatment data, progress on skill acquisition goals, and any relevant maladaptive behavior data to guide ongoing treatment, update protocols as clinically indicated, and ensure continued alignment with the authorized treatment plan and medical necessity.&quot;,&quot;IndirectServiceActivitiesCompleted&quot;:&quot;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Analyzed goal and behavior data from the sampling period&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reviewed maladaptive behavior frequency, duration, observed topography, and hypothesized function(s)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Evaluated treatment target responsiveness to current instructional strategies and prompting hierarchies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjusted or confirmed instructional protocols as clinically indicated based on analysis of treatment data; any updated procedures will be implemented by direct-care staff during upcoming treatment sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;priniting Jmeter results&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&quot;,&quot;AreasOfProgress&quot;:null,&quot;AreasLackOfProgress&quot;:null,&quot;AssessmentResult&quot;:0,&quot;StartTime&quot;:&quot;02:00:00&quot;,&quot;EndTime&quot;:&quot;02:30:00&quot;}</stringProp>
                  <stringProp name="Argument.metadata">=</stringProp>
                </elementProp>
              </collectionProp>
            </elementProp>
          </HTTPSamplerProxy>
